{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ更新してなくて\nごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ前に送信したはずのが\n送信されてなかったあああ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタさんからいただきました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく履いてます。\nあーたっかい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zepp Live in Tokyo..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高だったー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん、\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼編み込みヘアー／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が出演したのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪音が出ないギター(昼)\n人はなぜ走るのか？(夜)\n♪狼に口笛を\n♪せっかちなかたつむり\n♪春のメロディー\n♪涙がまだ悲しみだった頃(昼)\n左胸の勇気(夜)\n♪心の薬\n♪ぐるぐるカーテン\n♪おいでシャンプー\n♪走れ！Bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンコール\n♪会いたかったかもしれない\n♪制服のマネキン\n♪乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！\n今回はオリジナルメンバーだった為\n歌ってる曲全部出れたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのパワーのおかげで\n大成功に終えることができて\n本当よかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼まいまい、まなつと／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCではちょっとずつ\n2012年を振り返りました。\n懐かしかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなことしたんだなあ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかよみうりランドでやった\n初の全国握手会..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、出てなかったんだよおおお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学業で..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、振り返ったら\nあー悔しい！初だったもんなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブは良いね。\nもうね、はしゃぎまくったからね！\n本当楽しかった♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に帰ったらソファーに\nばたんきゅーしてしまってね！\nそのまま寝てました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年ももうちょいで\n終わっちゃうのね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"掃除して、気持ちよく\n来年を迎えたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエスト6\nセーラー服全身"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/28/7625550/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このスカート丈がよい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}